.TH GHOSTNET 1 "October 2026" "GHOSTNET 1.4.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghostnet \- prepare, build and run projects from the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghostnet
.RI [ command ] " [options] [folder]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
GHOSTNET detects project descriptors and delegates to native project tools.
Run without arguments for the animated arrow-key menu.
English and Russian interfaces are available as ghostnet and ghostnet-ru.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor [folder]
Inspect tool paths, versions, project environment and Python requirements.
No installation or build is performed.
.TP
.B setup [folder]
Prepare dependencies explicitly. Python uses .venv and requirements.txt;
Cargo uses fetch, npm uses ci with a lock file or install otherwise.
CMake configures the project and lets its existing rules resolve dependencies.
.TP
.B build | run | test [folder]
Build, build and run, or execute the project's native tests.
.TP
.B watch [folder]
Build and run, then restart after source changes. Ctrl+C stops the launcher
and running program. Dependency and generated directories are ignored.
.TP
.B clean [folder]
Remove recorded GHOSTNET outputs that have not been modified.
Sources, virtual environments and unrecorded files are preserved.
.TP
.B init --type TYPE folder
Create a minimal project without overwriting existing files.
.TP
.B inspect | languages | recent
Show project information, supported languages or recent projects.
.TP
.B update | auto-update enable | auto-update disable | auto-update status
Update an installer-managed version or manage daily automatic updates.
Package-managed installations use their package manager.
.TP
.B completion bash | zsh | powershell
Print shell completion definitions for sourcing in your shell profile.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --target native|linux|windows|macos|both
Select platform; project tool adapters support native builds.
.TP
.B --mode MODE
Override automatic builder detection.
.TP
.B --run-file PATH
Select the project entry point.
.TP
.B --no-animation
Disable terminal animations.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
ghostnet doctor .
ghostnet setup .
ghostnet run --run-file app.py .
ghostnet watch .
ghostnet clean .
ghostnet init --type cmake my-project
.fi
.SH FILES
Build and Python dependency installation failures save reports under
$XDG_STATE_HOME/ghostnet/reports or ~/.local/state/ghostnet/reports.
Reports include the invoked command, tool versions and diagnostic output.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cmake (1), cargo (1), npm (1), python (1)
